# Turret kits: buy or earn one, tow it into position, unfold it.
#
# The kit is a physical CRATE, not an inventory row, on purpose. Deploying a turret is
# then a crew job - eject it, grab it with the grav tether, fly it to the chokepoint,
# release, unfold - rather than a button press. It also gives the tether a use it is
# genuinely good at: engine-measured, a tractor holds a load at a rope length just fine.
#
# EVERYTHING THAT SPAWNS IS //shared/signal. A plain //signal route registers on the
# server AND on every connected console, so a six-bridge crew would deploy six turrets
# from one click.
#
# Adding a tower kind needs NO code here: write a `type: prefab/turret` prefab and an
# item whose `turret_prefab` names it. The crate carries the prefab name and the deploy
# route spawns whatever it says.


# --- the kits -----------------------------------------------------------------------
# `price` is all it takes to appear in the station Market comms - market_purchasable()
# collects every item label that has one. The same keys are grantable as quest rewards.

=== prefab_item_turret_kit_beam
metadata:``` yaml
type: item/deployable/turret
key: turret_kit_beam
display_text: Beam Turret Kit
art: container_4a
mode: consumable
targets: ship, cockpit
consoles: weapons, engineering
tier: 2
price: 450
turret_prefab: prefab_lm_turret_tower
desc: Ejects a turret kit. Tow it into position and deploy it.
```
    lm_turret_eject_crate(UPGRADE_AGENT_ID, "prefab_lm_turret_tower", "Beam Turret Kit")
    ->END

